nDynamic Progression \u2013 Survive as long as you can; every miss brings you closer to game over.\n\nImmersive Audio & Music \u2013 Energetic voice lines, punch feedback, and adaptive music keep you pumped.\n\nLeaderboards \u2013 Track your performance and compete with others for the top score.\n\nArcade-Style Replayability \u2013 Quick to start, hard to master, and always addictive.\n\nWhether you\u2019re warming up, competing for high scores, or just blowing off steam, Punchverse VR delivers a fun, fast-paced boxing experience right inside your headset.", "short_description": "Step into the ring like never before! Punchverse VR is an immersive virtual reality boxing challenge where your speed, reflexes, and endurance are put to the ultimate test."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1OCqMZ736rfvTwXnk_mAO73hXMKDrcTNWSAGpozxf2zk/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Paranoma 3D", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/paranoma3D", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26903059866039267"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825345_1726074241874619_1282266223107701368_n.png?stp=